type: dataset
title: "Sauna Traditions of the World"
abstract: >-
  A reference dataset of 28 sauna and bathing traditions with heat source,
  typical temperature and humidity ranges, rituals, cooling practice, UNESCO
  status and headwear customs. Compiled reference ranges from general published
  descriptions, not measurements.
